Package: memscore
Title: R Interface to the Memscore Command Line Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Brad", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Native R wrappers for the memscore command line interface.
    The package scores image memorability, runs challenger benchmarks,
    and launches repeated FIGRIM studies by invoking an external command
    line backend with system2(), so it does not require reticulate.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
